how does RRF work?

its an algorithm that combines multiple ranked lists into a single unified list

basically the scoes of bm25 and semantic search differ drastically

bm25 --> 12.4, 8.1, 3.5 |   positive scores based on terms frequencies
vectors --> Based on cosine similarity or dot product (bounded decimals, usually between -1.0 and 1.0, or 0.0 and 1.0

we cannot just add the scores together: 12.4  +  0.84   | mathematically impossible
